 strength. After being somewhat weakened by this exchange, she is attacked by Tamao, who is barely able to defeat her. Following this, she is caught in a combined attack by both Yuka and Tamao and is presumed dead, although she makes a cameo appearance in a background in V.G. Max."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4d898beb9d989aec41a25989f38e6a0bf00883023f681c8dff1736cda352420.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5447ec36e0e48a9714febe1ae74bf63f0d060fe210c385d0b4adcc898058efb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6815","characterName":"武内 優香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6815"},"originalCharacterName":"武内 優香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"807"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: Kyokushin Karate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Tokyo metropolitan area."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: 3rd-year (senior) at city academy \"T\", part-time waitress (Hanna Miller's)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Fruits, video games."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Greasy middle-aged men, cowards."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Video games, making sweets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A practitioner of karate who resides in Tokyo. After her parents died when she was young, her grandfather took her in and trained her in the martial arts, including Karate and the manipulation of ki energy. She enters the VG tournaments simply for the purpose of furthering her training and testing herself against strong opponents. Her virtuous, outgoing personality wins her many friends among the other fighters, among whom are Chiho Masuda, Jun Kubota, and Satomi Yajima, she has been best friends with the latter for years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6815"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/248eb8a4338b9bd736a8b800a12317de54f5b5eb22b6e314cb31ad57e264683b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3aa145a70956c867afcf6c5ad841330999753a940fd0e952e9141317839a476.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6816","characterName":"増田 千穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6816"},"originalCharacterName":"増田 千穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"402"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Tokyo metropolitan area."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: 3rd-year (senior) at private high school \"A\", part-time waitress (CASO)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Boiled tofu, Japanese confectionery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Her grandfather (Atsuyuki), spicy things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Tea, flowers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A trained ninja and was once the heir apparent to her family's ninja clan. However, she desires a life of freedom and happiness and thus has run away, becoming a \"Missing-nin.\" She participates in hopes of using the prize money and free real estate to finance her new life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6816"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/9636ade554c0fc9a14190c077334b6f268381ec32d3efd5b019bd6719c71ff6f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8219513f2dbe9ef0397428284fa4094c33c7880d957ca1d85a82d0dab480e4a.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 瞳子","creatorId":"vndb:s2000","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2000","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2000","name":"真木 碧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:36502","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6817","characterName":"久保田 潤","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6817"},"originalCharacterName":"久保田 潤","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1118"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: Wrestling"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Kanagawa prefecture."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: First-year student (freshman) at American national university \"F\", part-time waitress (Ska Lark)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Stuffed toys, Chocolate sundaes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Weak men, cockroaches."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Collecting stuffed toys, watching sports games."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wrestler with vast amounts of strength, Jun once participated in the Olympics while in high school. However, she was ejected from the games due to repeated unsportsmanlike conduct. She later joins the V.G. competitions because she can treat her opponents as roughly as she pleases. Despite this however, Jun operates by her own personal honor code. She fiercely believes that the use of weaponry in a martial arts bout is unacceptable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6817"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37bc88e5a595597e75e0cf050fffd1236501a5ae2a2eeaa46813350c6f013e72.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b5c09be44658254368c7c2095bbca55e6380c4933a9280bcd9929b1ad9bc43b.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤井 舞","creatorId":"vndb:s1139","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1139","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1139","name":"藤井 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:36501","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6818","characterName":"楠 真奈美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6818"},"originalCharacterName":"楠 真奈美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"303"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"143"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"34"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: A mystery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Hyougo prefecture."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: 2nd-year (junior) at prefectural girl's high school \"K\", part-time waitress (Fushiya)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Her mother's homemade cookies, picture books."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Ghosts, pimentos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Film appreciation, reading, cosplay."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest competitor in the VG Tournament at age 16. Along with her relative youth, she is also woefully immature, often acting like a girl half her age. Despite this however, she is a surprisingly clever and capable fighter, incorporating the natural energeticness of a child, as well her own vivid imagination into her fighting style. Her reason for entering the competitions is solely to obtain the large cash prize awarded to the winner. She is often the most lighthearted competitor in any given tournament, treating the fights as if they were all a big game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6818"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c1d6d1bc07641cc2302195f562870599697b726a101deb0f714d9eb3d5b2a72.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98ffee4028fb4924eaec51f8c30105852e2f480ab907b7683f2c45cb46588919.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"莉子","creatorId":"vndb:s4848","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4848","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4848","name":"莉子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:36503","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6819","characterName":"梁瀬 かおり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6819"},"originalCharacterName":"梁瀬 かおり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"907"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: Tae Kwon Do."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Chiba prefecture."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: 2nd-year student at private junior college \"F\", part-time waitress (Mohi-kan)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Onsen, ice cream."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Dirty (minded/acting/living) people, raw fish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Collecting PC correspondence (E-mail), violin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A 19-year old computer technician schooled in the art of Tae Kwon Do. She initially entered the V.G. tournament to test her own abilities, but found herself humiliated in the final round by Reimi Jahana. Ever since, she has devoted her training to defeating the multi-time V.G. champion. Despite this, Kaori apparently bears no ill will towards her would-be rival and simply sees defeating her as part of the path she must travel to become stronger."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6819"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af94cd9017fe6acde01f3ba3fbb03898b58121240acab20c705b7054a7194cda.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec44b9cdd880d9a611c9688e9aa92e90c66834ad35fe4e7ed2d0e37bdfa157e9.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6820","characterName":"レイミ・謝華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6820"},"originalCharacterName":"レイミ・謝華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"227"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"49"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: Martial Arts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: U.S.A."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Third-year (junior) at private women's institute \"S\", leader of Jahana Group."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Fame, beauty, hot milk."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Ugliness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Chess, driving."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Head of the Jahana Group, the organization which supervises the V.G. tournaments. Reimi is wealthy, highly intelligent, and extremely beautiful. She is also a skilled martial artist and a three-time V.G. champion. Reimi initially sees the competitions as a chance to prove herself the strongest and most beautiful warrior of all, and takes a kind of perverse pleasure in watching those who lose against her be humiliated in various ways. After being defeated by Yuka, she reforms and re-enters the tournament with the hopes of regaining her title."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6820"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf509849845bc582997027da68b7946844223f9a75ccdac33c8bc3a52e8b909b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11ddd4c3835f7748f17d8a06e7fdebe3d07ce9c77034c0272df4a4a342dd9281.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6821","characterName":"八島 聡美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6821"},"originalCharacterName":"八島 聡美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1022"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"41"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fighting Style: Kyokushin Karate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace / Origin: Tokyo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: 3rd-year (senior) at city academy \"T\", part-time waitress (Bikkuri Monkey)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes / Loves: Effort, her little brother Daisuke."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes / Hates: Poverty, betrayal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Cooking, training."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young woman who lives with her younger brother, Daisuke. Their parents died when they were kids. She earns money for living expenses and school tuition by working part-time jobs while caring for Daisuke. While she is an honest, straightforward person, she is also practical and realistic when it comes to situations involving money. This is because they have no other living relatives to provide for them, Satomi is often forced to take various odd jobs simply in order to make ends meet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia and Fight-A-Base."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/602acd7f1c94